      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Choosing a right Solar System is quite an exhaustive and involved process unless you are just installing one for the sake of it. There are lots of frauds and shoddy sales representatives with superficial understanding of Solar Market & Systems. That’s where the very first Birender made the difference for us to make an informed decision for installing a for-for-purpose Solar System.I have been dealing with Birender from his early days in the energy sector and when I called him up for a discussion I was pleasantly surprised with his extensive knowledge and commitment to ensure my approach and plans for Solar Investment was worth its value and it was something which can cater for our future needs. Birender installed a monitor to first validate our energy consumption and based on that he provide 3 options with clearly articulating pros and cons of each option. At no point he was forcing us to commit or get into one particular type/size of system.We took our time and when we were ready, the whole experience was just walk in the park where he not only found the quality of workmanship and professionalism of his team was quite pleasing. It’s been over a month now and he still regularly checks on status of service and share his expert knowledge and offer relevant (free) services which I find very valuable and supportive to make sure we are drawing maximum value from our investments in Solar System.I highly recommend Birender for any of Solar Energy needs, give him try and you would be know why.Nithin",
