      "review_description": "It's been approx 6 months since I had my 11kw solar PV system installed and it's running well with no issues. I would have no issues usingBirender and ASAES again.The actual system installation from booking was carried out by him and his team quite fast.He was very easy to talk to and you can tell he just genuinely cares about the industry and what he does. He was always very punctual, polite and willing to help answer any questions I had. He didn't rush the quoting process in any way which I really appreciated.As a system designer I found Birenders knowledge of different inverters, panel brands, string configurations, battery setups, future planning needs and more very useful.Birender, it was a pleasure to work with you to install my system and I look forward to you installing any future upgrades I may need when an electric vehicle comes along!",
