      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My experience with ASAES in general and Birender in particular was fantastic. From the start, i.e. during quoting/proposal phase, I found him very professional and knowledgeable. I had a lot of questions in the beginning and having done my initial study I wanted to ensure that I get the best possible outcome. Perhaps what stood out the most was that unlike most other installers where I was merely speaking with a sales guy who had superficial knowledge and were throwing generalized proposals/information at me, Birender was able to answer most of my questions and advise me as to what will and will not work in my particular scenario which helped me finalize my system to my satisfaction.The proposal was highly competitive and the installation process was smooth and seamless. The electrician(s) engaged for installation were friendly and they ensured the job was done safely and tidily. Post installation inspections were organized by ASAES who also made sure that my monitoring app/portal was setup immediately. I had enough assistance to organise grid connection. Other than the one slight glitch in form of a failed optimizer, the system has worked without any issues. ASAES was quick to attend to the failure as soon as I reported it and coordinated with the manufacturer to organize replacement.Overall, very happy with my experience and highly recommend ASAES!",
