      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I got Birender Singh's reference from my friend and I further recommend Australian Solar & Energy Solutions (ASAES) very happily for their work as they have delivered a very fantastic customer experience from start to finish.He provided me with multiple options and PV system quotes to choose from, answered all my many questions and cleared my doubts. Each step was done efficiently and as per the time given. The inverter installation is the cleanest one I have ever seen by any other installer. Process of system connection to grid via the service provider was smooth and taken care by ASAES.Birender keeps following up from time to time and he has remotely done couple of software upgrades too. Recently I had high AC voltage getting delivered at my home from the grid, which he easily got resolved by getting in touch with the service provider. I'm very satisfied by their before and after sale service as there was not even a single instance where I had to intervene or worry about.Overall the product is performing well and I am seeing the return of investment within a year of installation. Kudos to the ASAES team.",
